  "Cilindro para velas, té, dulces": "Cylinder for candles, tea, candy",
  "Clientes de todo México publican lo que necesitan fabricar y los talleres de la red mandan su precio y tiempo de entrega. El cliente compara, elige y paga protegido dentro de HETNA.": "Customers across Mexico post what they need manufactured, and shops in the network send their price and lead time. The customer compares, chooses and pays with protection within HETNA.",
