  "Prueba gratis. Cuando la trayectoria te convenza, pide el programa listo para tu controlador. El nivel (Básica, Media o Alta) se asigna solo, según el tiempo de mecanizado. Se entrega en tu cuenta.": "Try it free. When you're happy with the toolpath, order the program ready for your controller. The level (Basic, Medium or High) is assigned automatically based on machining time. It's delivered to your account.",
  "Publica tu pieza con plano o modelo 3D y talleres de maquinado de México te mandan su precio y tiempo de entrega.": "Post your part with a drawing or 3D model and machine shops in Mexico will send you their price and lead time.",
  "Publica tus cursos y tus libros en PDF gratis. Te mostramos con toda la comunidad CNC y ganas al momento en que ven tus videos o compran tu libro.": "Publish your courses and PDF books for free. We showcase you to the whole CNC community, and you earn the moment people watch your videos or buy your book.",
