  "Repórtalo desde la liga de tu solicitud antes de confirmar que la recibiste. Si le pagaste a HETNA, retenemos el pago al taller; en todo caso pedimos evidencia a los dos (fotos, guía, mensajes, acuerdo SafeDeal) y buscamos resolver en 5 días hábiles: liberar el pago, reembolso parcial o total. Esto no limita tu derecho de acudir a la PROFECO.": "Report it from your request link before confirming you received it. If you paid HETNA, we hold the payment to the shop; in any case, we ask both sides for evidence (photos, tracking number, messages, SafeDeal agreement) and aim to resolve it within 5 business days: releasing the payment, or a partial or full refund. This doesn't limit your right to go to PROFECO.",
